  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "[NOTE: i'm NOT using a modded client here. this is something the website does on it's own]\nHere's a breakdown of what's the issue:\nSay, i wanna join on a friend through the website.\nBy clicking on the world it shows them to be at, it will open a window separate from the website, where i can launch VRChat to open on that exact instance where the friend is at.\nNow, say that friend switched to an orange status, while also staying on the instance. Because that separate world launching window is not connected to the main website, it will still let me join that instance! Even if the main website updates their status.\nIt will even work if every person had already left the instance!\nI hope a work around will be able to be developed for the website. As it's ability to take you to an instance even if a friend switches to an orange status while they are there, could lead to negative outcomes.",
